[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_CRYSTAL_FREEDOM]
Price of Freedom

[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_CRYSTAL_FREEDOM_desc]
§g“It is for freedom that Sombra has set us free. Stand firm, then, and do not let yourselves be burdened again by a yoke of slavery.”§!\nUmbrums should not be the only free will in this country, and the helmet can only do so much: those ponies whose minds are occupied by fear may be qualified warriors, but they are not enough to keep Sombra’s empire up with this unpredictable era. We need minds, free minds... or just those appear to be. Take off their helmets and those tangible shackles, give hope to the losers, reward the winners with the freedom they have been dreaming of, but behind all this, everything is bound by invisible chains.

[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_CRYSTAL_FREEDOM_TOOLTIP]
Unlock decison in §YUmbrum Cataclysm§!: §YService for Freedom§!.

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_CRYSTAL_FREEDOM]
自由的代价

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_CRYSTAL_FREEDOM_desc]
§g“为自由，森布拉释放了我们。所以要站稳，不要再让自己被奴役的轭所累。”§!\n影魔不该是这个国家唯一存在的自由意志，头盔所能做的也仅仅是有限的：那些被恐惧所占据思维的小马也许可以做合格的战士，但却不足以让森布拉的帝国继续跟进这个变化莫测的时代。我们需要头脑，自由的头脑... 或许仅仅是表面上的。摘下他们的头盔和那些有形的镣铐，给予那些失败者以希望，赏赐那些成功者以他们梦寐以求的自由，但在这一切的背后用不可见的锁链束缚着这一切。

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_CRYSTAL_FREEDOM_TOOLTIP]
解锁§Y影魔现世§!中的决议：§Y战功换自由§!。

